 "issues": [
  {
   "issue_id": "issue-0001",
   "severity": "blocking",
   "category": "科学语义",
   "description_zh": "门户把 CT.gov 登记为『Change From Baseline …』的终点标注为『绝对值』，统计口径与登记原文相反。reports/B/v1/html/trials/nct03181633.html 与 overview.html 的卡片显示『游离血红蛋白 · 绝对值 · 约6个月』59.83 mg/dL，登记原文为『Change From Baseline in Free Hgb at Week 25』；同页卡片『补体抑制药效学指标 · 绝对值』显示 -46.36 percent，登记原文为『Change From Baseline in AP Complement Functional Activity at Week 25』；trials/nct04469465.html 与 efficacy.html 的『补体抑制药效学指标 · 绝对值 · 第12周』显示 -19.0 percent 与 -15.06 percent，登记原文为『Change From Baseline in Complement Component 3 Fragment Deposition (C3d PNH Type 3 Cells) on PNH RBCs at Week 12』。负值被标注为『绝对值』本身矛盾，且证据下钻只回显粗粒度要素名『补体抑制药效学指标』并注明『原文未提供』，门户内无任何位置显示登记终点名称，读者无法据门户恢复『较基线变化』口径。受影响记录：b-eff-2728、b-eff-2729、b-eff-2730、b-eff-2731、b-eff-3627、b-eff-3628。",
   "source_version_id": "source-version_55200e1b0b4ef7396f38a63b",
   "fragment_ids": [
    "evidence-fragment_6db3d545ffbfdc9c229049f6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "issue_id": "issue-0002",
   "severity": "blocking",
   "category": "科学语义",
   "description_zh": "同类登记终点的统计形式标注互相不一致且与登记原文不符。NCT04469465 中『Percentage of Participants With Transfusion Avoidance Through Week 12』被标为『应答率』，而同试验『Percentage of Participants With Hgb Increase of ≥2 g/dL (≥ 20 g/L) From Baseline』与『Percentage of Participants With Hgb Normalization at Week 12/24』被标为『较基线变化』（portal 卡片显示 59.5 percent、54.4 percent、41.8 percent、28.6 percent、26.3 percent、20 percent，登记单位为 percentage of participants，是参与者比例而非较基线变化量）。NCT04170023 中『Number of Participants Who Had Transfusion Avoidance During 12 Weeks of Treatment』（登记单位 Participants，值 9/10/5）在 products/alxn2050.html 的卡片上以『输血回避/输血量 · 应答率』配单位 Participants 与 0—20 计数轴呈现，把例数标成率。受影响记录：b-eff-2685、b-eff-2686、b-eff-2687、b-eff-2688、b-eff-2715、b-eff-2736、b-eff-2737、b-eff-2738、b-eff-2739、b-eff-2740、b-eff-4089、b-eff-4090、b-eff-4091。",
   "source_version_id": "source-version_55200e1b0b4ef7396f38a63b",
   "fragment_ids": [
    "evidence-fragment_6db3d545ffbfdc9c229049f6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "issue_id": "issue-0003",
   "severity": "blocking",
   "category": "证据覆盖声明",
   "description_zh": "试验完成情况域被声明为『暂无公开记录』，但所引用的登记来源对该域确有公开结果。reports/B/v1/html/disposition-overview.html（试验完成情况总览）与 participant-flow.html（受试者流转）正文显示『暂无公开记录（试验完成情况）。本页没有可接受的专属记录，未以其他结果页替代。』（同一文案另见 adherence.html、loss-exit.html、screen-failure.html、rescue-treatment.html、prohibited-medication.html、plan-deviation.html）。而 NCT05886244 在所引用来源片段的登记结果中带有 participantFlowModule：Primary Treatment Period (12 Weeks) STARTED 25 / COMPLETED 25 / NOT COMPLETED 0，Long-Term Extension Period (52 Weeks) STARTED 25 / COMPLETED 20 / NOT COMPLETED 5；NCT04469465、NCT02605993、NCT03181633、NCT02591862、NCT04170023 亦各有分期受试者流转记录。门户对用户断言该域无公开记录，与实际来源状态不符；受试者流转与完成情况总览两页应据该公开记录如实呈现或改写为来源未纳入的准确限制说明。",
   "source_version_id": "source-version_722a6707f3e108dbe168b50e",
   "fragment_ids": [
    "evidence-fragment_403cdbea3b549b7ee454e3d2"
   ]
  }
